<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>QR Scanner</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/style.css"><script src="https://unpkg.com/html5-qrcode"></script></head><body><main class="wrap"><h1>Camera QR Scanner</h1><p><a href="/admin">← Dashboard</a></p><div class="panel"><p>Allow camera access, then scan each guest's QR ticket. On phones, the published website must use HTTPS for the camera to open. Multiple admins can scan from separate logged-in devices.</p><div id="reader" style="max-width:460px"></div></div><script>function onScanSuccess(decodedText){ window.location.href = decodedText; } new Html5QrcodeScanner('reader',{fps:10,qrbox:250}).render(onScanSuccess);</script></main></body></html>
